WEBVTT

00:24.050 --> 00:25.740
<i>My first time switching schools...</i>

00:26.320 --> 00:29.700
<i>Dad decided to open a 
studio in the countryside,</i>

00:30.000 --> 00:32.190
<i>so we left Tokyo,</i>

00:32.490 --> 00:34.510
<i>and I changed schools.</i>

00:35.380 --> 00:37.180
<i>I wonder if I'll be okay</i>

00:37.180 --> 00:40.560
<i>in my new place.</i>

01:13.050 --> 01:18.970
<b>Episode 12
"Fireworks
(Once Again)"</b>

02:55.720 --> 02:56.630
<b>Are you okay?</b>

02:56.630 --> 02:58.360
<b>Yes, I'm fine.</b>

02:59.530 --> 03:01.080
<b>Thank you.</b>

03:01.080 --> 03:02.010
<b>No worries.</b>

03:02.820 --> 03:03.480
<b>Bye.</b>

03:03.780 --> 03:04.700
<b>Wait.</b>

03:04.700 --> 03:07.580
<b>Hinode-hama Port Station</b>

03:05.940 --> 03:07.130
<b>Over here.</b>

03:15.240 --> 03:16.580
<b>It's the harbor!</b>

03:21.100 --> 03:22.800
<b>I'm Touko Fukami.</b>

03:23.240 --> 03:25.180
<b>I'm Kakeru Okikura.</b>

03:25.650 --> 03:28.000
<b>Thanks again for before.</b>

03:28.300 --> 03:29.120
<b>The fireworks.</b>

03:29.850 --> 03:31.270
<b>You're here for the fireworks, right?</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:35.480
<b>Not too many are around yet, 
but there'll be more people.</b>

03:35.480 --> 03:36.660
<b>I moved here.</b>

03:37.390 --> 03:39.490
<b>There's a fireworks festival today?</b>

03:39.920 --> 03:40.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:40.680 --> 03:41.890
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

03:42.380 --> 03:46.120
<b>There's a beach and a pier 
to the right of that harbor.</b>

03:46.640 --> 03:48.120
<b>That's the stage for the fireworks.</b>

03:48.620 --> 03:49.690
<b>Ah.</b>

03:56.380 --> 03:59.130
<b>Café Kazemichi</b>

04:03.060 --> 04:05.140
<b>Kakeru's late.</b>

04:05.650 --> 04:08.620
<b>I bet he's snowed in
 and stuck in his tent.</b>

04:08.950 --> 04:12.950
<b>He's still living in his tent? In this snow?</b>

04:12.950 --> 04:14.210
<b>I doubt it.</b>

04:14.640 --> 04:16.560
<b>If Sacchan says no, then no.</b>

04:16.560 --> 04:17.710
<b>Say what?</b>

04:18.930 --> 04:19.610
<b>Hey.</b>

04:23.670 --> 04:26.030
<b>Here's your hot orange.</b>

04:28.660 --> 04:30.220
<b>I'm Touko Fukami.</b>

04:30.220 --> 04:31.410
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

04:41.350 --> 04:43.630
<b>So, are you going to introduce yourselves?</b>

04:43.970 --> 04:45.360
<b>Oh, right.</b>

04:45.360 --> 04:46.710
<b>I'm Hiro Shirosaki.</b>

04:47.010 --> 04:48.930
<b>My name's Yanagi Takayama.</b>

04:49.360 --> 04:51.850
<b>I'm Yukinari Imi.</b>

04:52.190 --> 04:55.140
<b>What's with that? Yuki was
just staring at Fukami-san.</b>

04:55.140 --> 04:58.070
<b>Yukinari falls in love with everyone.</b>

04:58.070 --> 04:59.560
<b>Dude.</b>

04:59.560 --> 05:01.810
<b>It'll be my job to show her</b>

05:01.810 --> 05:04.280
<b>around Hinode-hama today.</b>

05:04.690 --> 05:06.430
<b>Too bad, Yuki.</b>

05:07.090 --> 05:09.740
<b>I'm Sachi Nagamiya.
Nice to meet you.</b>

05:09.990 --> 05:11.710
<b>Nice to meet you, too.</b>

05:15.580 --> 05:19.510
<b>My father is opening a studio here.</b>

05:19.510 --> 05:20.450
<b>A studio?</b>

05:20.450 --> 05:24.420
<b>Yeah, he makes art glass 
and vases and things.</b>

05:25.110 --> 05:26.480
<b>That's so cool.</b>

05:26.480 --> 05:29.550
<b>I think it's a lot more hot and 
tedious than you might think.</b>

05:30.040 --> 05:33.850
<b>You're here for the fireworks, right? 
The fireworks here are pretty awesome.</b>

05:34.420 --> 05:35.690
<b>Well...</b>

05:37.950 --> 05:41.270
<b>Apparently, she didn't know 
about the fireworks today.</b>

05:41.880 --> 05:43.060
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

05:43.060 --> 05:46.620
<b>We all get together every 
year to watch the fireworks</b>

05:46.620 --> 05:48.950
<b>from a place called Hinode-hama Shrine.</b>

05:49.430 --> 05:52.620
<b>It's been a long time now. 
All the way from elementary school?</b>

05:53.130 --> 05:56.370
<b>I think it's been like that
ever since we set up</b>

05:56.370 --> 05:59.480
<b>a weird new rule when we were younger</b>

05:59.480 --> 06:02.130
<b>that we always had to 
be in groups of three.</b>

06:02.480 --> 06:06.330
<b>It's something that ends up happening 
without anyone really talking about it.</b>

06:07.490 --> 06:08.930
<b>You should come with us.</b>

06:09.190 --> 06:10.800
<b>It'll be twice as fun.</b>

06:10.800 --> 06:12.070
<b>May I?</b>

06:12.070 --> 06:14.220
<b>Of course. Right, Yuki?</b>

06:14.220 --> 06:15.180
<b>Of course.</b>

06:15.180 --> 06:16.710
<b>It's settled, then.</b>

06:16.710 --> 06:17.450
<b>Okay.</b>

06:20.240 --> 06:21.970
<b>Are you not used to the snow?</b>

06:22.270 --> 06:25.730
<b>Yeah, I grew up where there's no snow.</b>

06:28.570 --> 06:30.650
<b>Try to keep your center of gravity 
straight above your body,</b>

06:30.950 --> 06:32.370
<b>and walk in small steps.</b>

06:32.790 --> 06:33.730
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:35.980 --> 06:39.840
<b>You can see all of Hinode-hama from 
the deck on the fourth floor here.</b>

06:40.280 --> 06:41.330
<b>Want to go up?</b>

06:56.350 --> 06:57.980
<b>I can't wait for the fireworks.</b>

06:58.740 --> 07:01.040
<b>You don't really hear about 
fireworks in the winter, do you?</b>

07:01.370 --> 07:04.690
<b>Yeah. I wonder what fireworks 
are like in the snow.</b>

07:05.360 --> 07:07.610
<b>You probably wouldn't be able 
to see them anywhere else.</b>

07:08.100 --> 07:11.290
<b>Everyone else is looking forward
 to going with you, too, Touko.</b>

07:11.770 --> 07:13.600
<b>You're calling me by my first name.</b>

07:14.280 --> 07:17.800
<b>Touko, are you going to Hinode-hama 
High School for your third year?</b>

07:23.570 --> 07:25.000
<b>Yeah, I hope to.</b>

07:25.710 --> 07:28.010
<b>Must be tough transferring 
in your third year.</b>

07:28.540 --> 07:32.320
<b>I'm want to go to art school, so it's probably 
more about practice than studying.</b>

07:32.320 --> 07:33.310
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

07:33.750 --> 07:35.250
<b>Are you taking over for your father?</b>

07:35.550 --> 07:39.000
<b>I haven't decided yet.</b>

07:40.570 --> 07:44.570
<b>I've never been outside this 
town, so I don't really know.</b>

07:45.090 --> 07:46.600
<b>What's it like being in a new town?</b>

07:47.880 --> 07:48.940
<b>It's exciting.</b>

07:49.830 --> 07:52.950
<b>I want to see the city more 
before the fireworks start.</b>

07:52.950 --> 07:54.110
<b>I'll show you around some more.</b>

07:55.160 --> 07:56.170
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:56.170 --> 07:57.950
<b>But I'll try walking by myself.</b>

07:58.470 --> 08:00.220
<b>Yeah? Good idea.</b>

08:00.850 --> 08:04.830
<b>It's not a big town, and everyone's nice.</b>

08:13.230 --> 08:15.220
<b>I heard there's a new girl.</b>

08:15.540 --> 08:17.880
<b>I won't ask you to knock anymore,</b>

08:17.880 --> 08:20.060
<b>but when you're coming up to a boy's room,</b>

08:20.060 --> 08:22.690
<b>can you at least put out a
vibe that you're approaching?</b>

08:23.280 --> 08:24.060
<b>Why?</b>

08:24.490 --> 08:27.620
<b>"Why?" Because it's dangerous.</b>

08:27.620 --> 08:29.990
<b>So how was she?</b>

08:29.990 --> 08:32.190
<b>She's passable.</b>

08:32.560 --> 08:35.330
<b>Nothing can beat the tragic 
glasses girl, huh?</b>

08:35.330 --> 08:38.100
<b>Go away, if you have nothing to say.</b>

08:38.400 --> 08:39.510
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

08:40.050 --> 08:41.450
<b>Tee hee!</b>

08:41.760 --> 08:43.160
<b>Dammit!</b>

08:56.980 --> 08:59.050
<b>Don't overdo it just 
because you seem okay.</b>

08:59.480 --> 09:02.630
<b>Roger. It'd be a shame if I got injured.</b>

09:04.160 --> 09:05.940
<b>Hurry up. It's cold.</b>

09:06.240 --> 09:07.370
<b>Twelve more seconds.</b>

09:07.370 --> 09:08.240
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

09:08.240 --> 09:11.370
<b>Your routine is important to you. I get it.</b>

09:11.670 --> 09:12.710
<b>That girl...</b>

09:13.320 --> 09:14.360
<b>Fukami-san?</b>

09:15.630 --> 09:16.250
<b>Yeah?</b>

09:17.000 --> 09:18.370
<b>She's cute, don't you think?</b>

09:25.190 --> 09:26.040
<b>So cold.</b>

10:03.850 --> 10:07.920
<b>What's keeping him? He should be 
on his shorter route today.</b>

10:46.750 --> 10:47.750
<b>I'm home.</b>

10:48.350 --> 10:49.870
<b>Welcome back.</b>

10:50.810 --> 10:53.840
<b>Are you going to the fireworks 
with everyone, like always?</b>

10:53.840 --> 10:55.340
<b>Yeah, I plan to.</b>

10:55.750 --> 10:56.380
<b>What about you two?</b>

10:56.740 --> 10:59.380
<b>We'll be watching from the rooftop as usual.</b>

11:00.000 --> 11:02.930
<b>We've invited the Fukami-san family, too.</b>

11:02.930 --> 11:03.970
<b>Fukami-san?</b>

11:04.270 --> 11:07.680
<b>They have daughters in high 
school and middle school.</b>

11:07.680 --> 11:09.000
<b>Didn't I mention?</b>

11:09.000 --> 11:12.350
<b>They're opening a glassware studio nearby.</b>

11:12.700 --> 11:14.130
<b>Isn't it nice?</b>

11:14.130 --> 11:17.650
<b>It turns out they're in my fan club, too.</b>

11:17.650 --> 11:21.410
<b>I have plans to meet up with the older 
girl at Hinode-hama Shrine later.</b>

11:21.410 --> 11:22.200
<b>What?</b>

11:23.400 --> 11:24.500
<b>It just kinda happened.</b>

11:25.720 --> 11:27.540
<b>It's going to be really crowded.</b>

11:27.540 --> 11:30.120
<b>It's her first time in Hinode-hama, right?</b>

11:30.530 --> 11:32.250
<b>Do you think you can find her?</b>

11:32.750 --> 11:35.970
<b>Oh, yeah, I guess I should go pick her up.</b>

11:36.940 --> 11:38.760
<b>Oh, looks like they're already here.</b>

11:39.690 --> 11:41.960
<b>She called me on her cell 
phone before we got here,</b>

11:41.960 --> 11:43.940
<b>and she said she wanted 
to look around the city.</b>

11:43.940 --> 11:45.010
<b>I see.</b>

11:45.010 --> 11:47.530
<b>Do you need Touko's cell phone number?</b>

11:47.530 --> 11:48.720
<b>Yes, please.</b>

11:49.390 --> 11:51.320
<b>Onee-chan moves fast.</b>

11:51.320 --> 11:54.420
<b>I know, in a blink of an eye. 
I wonder who she got that from.</b>

12:00.560 --> 12:02.660
<b>She seems to have a fever.</b>

12:03.810 --> 12:05.960
<b>Anyway, come in.</b>

12:05.960 --> 12:06.870
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:09.240 --> 12:10.450
<b>Sacchan, are you okay?</b>

12:14.780 --> 12:16.750
<b>Do you think you can make it?</b>

12:18.150 --> 12:19.250
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:27.480 --> 12:30.770
<b>Damn, I don't have my phone, either.</b>

13:05.240 --> 13:06.010
<b>Wow.</b>

13:37.130 --> 13:38.350
<b>It's so pretty.</b>

13:39.610 --> 13:42.880
<b>I'll be at the neighborhood association.</b>

13:43.360 --> 13:45.910
<b>Okay. Don't be too late.</b>

13:45.910 --> 13:46.840
<b>Okay.</b>

13:47.270 --> 13:50.550
<b>Sorry, please take care of Sachi for me.</b>

13:50.850 --> 13:52.770
<b>I will. Leave it to me.</b>

13:59.110 --> 14:01.730
<i>Yuki, that idiot. It's already starting!</i>

14:18.310 --> 14:19.530
<b>Hey.</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:21.840
<b>Hey, don't take off on your own!</b>

14:22.200 --> 14:24.300
<b>What? You're late.</b>

14:26.010 --> 14:26.800
<b>Hey!</b>

14:28.190 --> 14:28.930
<b>Yeah?</b>

14:31.420 --> 14:32.400
<b>What is it?</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:35.060
<b>No, I—</b>

14:35.740 --> 14:37.910
<b>What? Is something wrong?</b>

14:38.210 --> 14:40.540
<i>What, they don't remember me?</i>

14:40.540 --> 14:42.770
<i>But we just met.</i>

14:43.540 --> 14:44.560
<i>Are they acting?</i>

14:44.870 --> 14:45.840
<i>Is this a prank?</i>

14:45.840 --> 14:46.940
<i>Are they serious?</i>

14:47.370 --> 14:49.880
<i>They seriously don't recognize me?</i>

14:51.290 --> 14:53.590
<b>It's nothing, thanks.</b>

14:53.590 --> 14:54.620
<b>Is there anything we can—</b>

14:54.620 --> 14:56.580
<b>No, it's fine, really.</b>

14:59.860 --> 15:00.970
<b>Weird girl.</b>

15:00.970 --> 15:01.670
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:08.420 --> 15:12.170
<b>Hina, I bet you wanted 
to go with Kakeru-kun.</b>

15:12.170 --> 15:15.460
<b>Nope, I don't like crowds.</b>

15:15.460 --> 15:16.410
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

15:19.410 --> 15:21.730
<i>I wonder if Onee-chan's making the most of it.</i>

15:26.420 --> 15:27.910
<b>Tamaya!</b>

15:29.430 --> 15:33.200
<b>You know some pretty old cheers, Hina-chan.</b>

15:39.600 --> 15:42.570
<b>It's pretty awesome this year, too.</b>

15:57.230 --> 15:58.260
<b>Sorry.</b>

15:58.590 --> 15:59.480
<b>It's okay.</b>

16:24.770 --> 16:27.040
<b>I finally found you.</b>

16:28.900 --> 16:29.620
<b>Hurry!</b>

16:29.620 --> 16:30.750
<b>Wait up!</b>

16:31.070 --> 16:32.510
<b>I thought I'd lost you.</b>

16:34.190 --> 16:36.560
<b>You can see me?</b>

16:38.040 --> 16:38.980
<b>Never mind.</b>

16:38.980 --> 16:41.910
<b>I was worried. You wouldn't 
pick up your phone either.</b>

16:44.680 --> 16:46.040
<b>It's turned off.</b>

16:48.750 --> 16:50.380
<b>Is everyone else here yet?</b>

16:50.680 --> 16:51.730
<b>Over there.</b>

16:51.730 --> 16:53.530
<b>But it's weird.</b>

16:54.110 --> 16:57.360
<b>It's like they can't see me.</b>

17:39.330 --> 17:41.220
<b>The fireworks are starting already.</b>

17:41.540 --> 17:42.960
<b>It kinda hurts.</b>

17:45.380 --> 17:46.550
<b>Do you want to watch from here?</b>

17:47.350 --> 17:49.690
<b>Aren't they waiting at the shrine?</b>

17:50.080 --> 17:51.500
<b>It'll be nice for a change.</b>

17:53.630 --> 17:56.260
<b>Doesn't look like we'll be able 
to make it to the shrine.</b>

17:57.220 --> 17:58.140
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:58.140 --> 18:01.510
<b>It's okay. We'll make do 
by ourselves this year.</b>

18:01.800 --> 18:05.210
<b>Variety is the, uh, what was it—</b>

18:06.240 --> 18:07.220
<b>Spice of life?</b>

18:07.220 --> 18:08.120
<b>Yeah, that's it.</b>

18:08.120 --> 18:10.020
<b>Another spice of life.</b>

18:31.240 --> 18:32.330
<b>It's so pretty.</b>

18:33.470 --> 18:35.250
<b>Can I see, too, Sachi?</b>

18:35.250 --> 18:37.070
<b>I'm next.</b>

18:37.070 --> 18:38.650
<b>You're so obvious.</b>

18:38.650 --> 18:39.860
<b>About what?</b>

18:39.860 --> 18:41.680
<b>Fine, fine, you're next.</b>

18:41.680 --> 18:44.710
<b>I don't think that counts as 
an indirect kiss, though.</b>

18:45.340 --> 18:46.820
<b>Indirect what?</b>

18:46.820 --> 18:47.730
<b>Here.</b>

18:50.900 --> 18:54.310
<b>Is this the world of my 
fragments of the future?</b>

18:54.310 --> 18:55.550
<b>Seems like it.</b>

18:56.080 --> 18:59.430
<b>So you're the Kakeru-kun that I imagined?</b>

18:59.430 --> 19:00.280
<b>Yeah,</b>

19:00.760 --> 19:02.860
<b>and I'm different 
again from my earlier self.</b>

19:03.280 --> 19:06.410
<b>You could say I'm a projection of</b>

19:06.410 --> 19:07.900
<b>myself from your reality.</b>

19:08.300 --> 19:11.580
<b>So you <i>are</i> Kakeru-kun 
from my imaginary world.</b>

19:11.580 --> 19:13.200
<b>That would be correct.</b>

19:13.620 --> 19:16.370
<b>So what about Yana-chan and 
the others, over there?</b>

19:16.890 --> 19:18.450
<b>They're not real either,</b>

19:18.450 --> 19:21.140
<b>in a different sense.</b>

19:21.730 --> 19:23.010
<b>They're not real?</b>

19:23.310 --> 19:27.320
<b>They might have had some reasons 
that they couldn't get together here.</b>

19:31.290 --> 19:32.740
<b>Are you real?</b>

19:33.040 --> 19:34.560
<b>Yeah, I'm definitely real.</b>

19:34.860 --> 19:37.090
<b>And my loneliness earlier?</b>

19:47.750 --> 19:51.260
<i>During the fireworks show,</i>

19:51.560 --> 19:54.080
<i>I can't be seen by the Yana-chan and Sacchan</i>

19:54.080 --> 19:56.620
<i>and Hiro-kun and Yuki-kun of this world.</i>

19:57.410 --> 20:01.180
<i>Because I don't have an unforgettable place</i>

20:01.180 --> 20:03.990
<i>where I spent time with them.</i>

20:05.560 --> 20:08.330
<i>Right, Kakeru-kun?</i>

21:27.280 --> 21:28.300
<i>Nothing.</i>

21:28.860 --> 21:30.210
<i>It's nothing.</i>

23:31.750 --> 23:33.060
<b>I like the name "Touko."</b>

23:33.060 --> 23:34.190
<b>I'll hear it later.</b>

23:34.190 --> 23:35.430
<b>Keep your promise.</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:36.550
<b>It changed?</b>

23:36.550 --> 23:37.820
<b>It's my fault.</b>

23:37.930 --> 23:40.890
<b>Final Episode
"Shooting Star"</b>

23:39.140 --> 23:40.320
<b>Don't go.</b>
